    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-23-450: Eucalyptus Grove Apartments, located at 1875 California Drive in Burlingame, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $3,091,584 in annual federal tax credits and $10,727,825 in total state tax credits to finance the new construction of 68 units of housing serving families with rents affordable to households earning 20%-50% of area median income (AMI).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001636"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State report lists financial assistance as LIHTC, MHP, VHHP, CDLAC, AHP and other (San Mateo County Measure K, AHF 10.0, and City of Burlingame).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County Department of Housing (Jan. 2024): construction started in late December 2023.",
